  <data name="Exhibit_Venus_Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Venus de Milo (Aphrodite)</value></data>
  <data name="Exhibit_Venus_Desc" xml:space="preserve"><value>Ancient Greek sculpture believed to depict Aphrodite, the goddess of love and beauty, sculpted in Parian marble.</value></data>
